Package: ghostab
Version: 1.1.0-alpha
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AramCZ <aramcz@protonmail.com>
Depends: libx11-6, curl
Description: Tiny experimental browser engine written in Rust
 Ghostab is an early browser-engine experiment. This first Debian build
 provides a graphical app powered by Ghost Engine. It can load local files
 or fetch HTTP/HTTPS pages with curl, parse a small HTML subset, create a
 DOM, lay out simple block text, and render into a Linux desktop window.
